Okay, let's evaluate the 'Mercedes-Benz CLS Sport'.

The term "Sport" as a standalone trim level isn't typically used for the *most recent* generation of the Mercedes-Benz CLS (C257, 2018-2023) in major markets. Historically, Mercedes used "Sport" packages or trims, but for the latest models, the designation that signifies enhanced sporty aesthetics (wheels, body kit, interior details) below the full AMG performance model is the **"AMG Line"** trim.

Therefore, the closest functional and market equivalent to a hypothetical "Sport" trim on the most recent CLS is the **Mercedes-Benz CLS AMG Line**.

I will evaluate the **Mercedes-Benz CLS AMG Line (C257)** as the most relevant modern counterpart.

